{"branch":"상동점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">상동점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-faa4755ac2b7adf9.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"상동점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-faa4755ac2b7adf9.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 부천시 원미구 송내대로265번길 67 월드컵타운 3층 305호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 7호선</span><span>상동역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 7호선</span><span>부천시청역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>상동역7번출구.세이브존</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>상동역8번출구.세이브존</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>써미트빌.진달래마을</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>진달래마을써미트빌</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>상동역6번출구.세이브존</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>상동역1번출구.부천터미널소풍</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>진달래공원</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>16</span><span>27</span><span>33</span><span>5-4</span><span>83</span><span>23-2</span><span>52</span><span>56</span><span>59</span><span>59-1</span><span>6-2</span><span>66</span><span>70</span><span>5-3</span><span>61</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>24</span><span>37</span><span>87</span></dd></div><div><